---
name: Detect with TruePattern Sigma rules
description: |
  Matches OCSF events against the TruePattern Sigma rules and enriches the
  resulting detection findings with rule metadata.
---

// Replace this source with your OCSF events. The `sigma` operator reloads the
// rule file within 5 seconds after the update pipeline replaces it.
subscribe "ocsf"
sigma path="/var/lib/tenzir/truepattern/sigma.yaml"
truepattern::enrich
publish "truepattern-findings"
